<div class="policy-doc__body">
  <p>
    We do our best to provide continuous security updates for our IoT products. The security updates generally include the latest security patches, security vulnerability fixes, and other security improvements. We will maintain the security updates for at least 3 years from the launch day of certain device models.
  </p>
  <p>
    The support period will not be shortened after publication. If the defined support period is extended, we will update the lists below as soon as possible to help you check whether your device can still receive security updates.
  </p>

